  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting Intersectional Approaches to Teaching and Reseach</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will sensitize students and teachers at the National University of Science and Technology on issues related to sexual orientation and gender identity. The project will foster research and academic debate and influence institutional policy, to reduce homophobia and discrimination, and create a safe university environment for LGBTI students, in turn influencing public debate and opinion.</narrative>
  </description>
